<div class="pr-shell pr-settings-shell">
  <header class="pr-app-header">
    <div class="pr-brand"><i class="fa-solid fa-sliders"></i><div><h1>Polls, Points & Rewards Settings</h1><p>Configure reusable polls, point rules, and rewards for your table.</p></div></div>
  </header>

  <nav class="pr-tabs pr-settings-tabs">
    <button type="button" data-settings-tab="general"><i class="fa-solid fa-gear"></i> General</button>
    <button type="button" data-settings-tab="identity"><i class="fa-solid fa-link"></i> User / Actor</button>
    <button type="button" data-settings-tab="voting"><i class="fa-solid fa-square-poll-vertical"></i> Voting Profiles</button>
    <button type="button" data-settings-tab="reasons"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-plus"></i> Give Point Reasons</button>
    <button type="button" data-settings-tab="benefits"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift"></i> Redeem Benefits</button>
  </nav>

  <main class="pr-settings-body">
    <section data-settings-panel="general">
      <div class="pr-section-header"><div><h2>General</h2><p>The Actor folder is only a live participant filter. Changing it never moves, resets, or deletes points.</p></div></div>
      <div class="pr-settings-card">
        <label class="pr-field">Player Actor Folder
          <select name="actorFolderId">
            <option value="">— Select Actor Folder —</option>
            {{#each actorFolders}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}
          </select>
          <small>Actors directly inside this folder define the current players/candidates shown by the module.</small>
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="pr-settings-card">
        <h3>Point Method</h3>
        <div class="pr-method-grid">
          <label class="pr-method-card"><input type="radio" name="pointMethod" value="account" {{#if accountSelected}}checked{{/if}}><span><strong>Account-Wide Points</strong><small>One shared point balance per Primary User. All linked characters use the same pool.</small></span></label>
          <label class="pr-method-card"><input type="radio" name="pointMethod" value="character" {{#if characterSelected}}checked{{/if}}><span><strong>Character-Based Points</strong><small>Every Actor maintains an independent balance and point history.</small></span></label>
        </div>
        <p class="pr-setting-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-shuffle"></i> Changing method triggers a balance conversion preview. Account → Character divides equally and rounds down; Character → Account sums character balances.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pr-settings-card pr-toggle-list">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="allowNegativeBalance" {{#if config.allowNegativeBalance}}checked{{/if}}><span><strong>Allow Negative Balance</strong><small>GM may redeem benefits that cost more than the current balance. Debt is shown clearly before confirmation and in the player ledger.</small></span></label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="postVotingResultsToChat" {{#if config.postVotingResultsToChat}}checked{{/if}}><span><strong>Post Poll Results to Chat</strong><small>Publish the final result when the GM closes a poll. Public profiles reveal voter names; Secret profiles show totals only.</small></span></label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="showSheetPoints" {{#if config.showSheetPoints}}checked{{/if}}><span><strong>Show Points on Actor Sheets</strong><small>D&D5e character sheets receive icon-only Points access. Other systems use a safe sheet fallback.</small></span></label>
      </div>

      <div class="pr-settings-card pr-portable-config">
        <div><h3>Portable Ecosystem Configuration</h3><p>Export or import Voting Profiles, Give Point Reasons, and Redeem Benefits together. Player identities, Primary Users, balances, ledgers, folders, and World data are never included.</p></div>
        <div class="pr-config-transfer-actions">
          <button type="button" data-export-config="all"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-export"></i> Export All</button>
          <button type="button" data-import-config="all"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-import"></i> Import All</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section data-settings-panel="identity" hidden>
      <div class="pr-section-header"><div><h2>User / Actor Normalization</h2><p>Foundry Ownership controls who can operate an Actor. Primary User is the persistent identity used for account grouping and self-voting.</p></div></div>
      {{#if normalizationRows.length}}
        <div class="pr-normalization-head" aria-hidden="true"><span>Actor</span><span>Foundry Owners</span><span>Primary User</span><span>Status</span></div>
        <div class="pr-normalization-list">
          {{#each normalizationRows}}
            <article class="pr-normalization-row" data-normalization-row data-actor-id="{{actorId}}">
              <div class="pr-normalization-actor"><img src="{{actorImg}}" alt=""><strong>{{actorName}}</strong></div>
              <div class="pr-normalization-owners"><span>{{ownersLabel}}</span>{{#if ownerCount}}<small>{{ownerCount}} current non-GM Owner(s)</small>{{/if}}</div>
              <label class="pr-field pr-primary-user-field"><span class="sr-only">Primary User for {{actorName}}</span>
                <select name="primaryUser">
                  <option value="" {{#if unassignedSelected}}selected{{/if}}>— Unassigned —</option>
                  {{#each userOptions}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}
                </select>
              </label>
              <div class="pr-normalization-status pr-status-{{statusKey}}"><i class="fa-solid {{statusIcon}}"></i><span>{{status}}</span></div>
            </article>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
        <p class="pr-setting-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Once assigned, Primary User never changes automatically when Foundry Owners are added or removed. Changing Primary User does not move point balances; use Transfer only when a balance itself must move.</p>
      {{else}}
        <div class="pr-empty-state"><i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open"></i><p>No Actors are available in the currently selected Player Actor Folder. Save a folder selection first, then reopen settings to normalize its Actors.</p></div>
      {{/if}}
    </section>

    <section data-settings-panel="voting" hidden>
      <div class="pr-section-header">
        <div><h2>Voting Profiles</h2><p>Create reusable polls. Each profile contains 1–{{maxQuestions}} questions and can mix Actor Votes with custom Option Votes.</p></div>
        <div class="pr-section-actions"><button type="button" data-export-config="voting-profiles"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-export"></i> Export</button><button type="button" data-import-config="voting-profiles"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-import"></i> Import</button></div>
      </div>

      <div class="pr-profile-toolbar">
        <label class="pr-field pr-grow">Voting Profile
          <select name="votingProfileSelect">{{#each votingProfiles}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
        </label>
        <button type="button" data-action="add-profile"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> New Profile</button>
        <button type="button" data-action="delete-profile" data-tooltip="Delete selected Voting Profile"><i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i></button>
        <button type="button" data-action="add-question"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Add Question</button>
      </div>

      <div data-profile-panels>
        {{#each votingProfiles}}
          <section class="pr-voting-profile-editor" data-voting-profile data-profile-id="{{id}}" {{#unless selected}}hidden{{/unless}}>
            <div class="pr-profile-meta-grid">
              <label class="pr-field pr-wide">Profile Name<input name="profileName" value="{{name}}" maxlength="80" required></label>
              <label class="pr-compact-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="profileSelfVoting" {{#if allowSelfVoting}}checked{{/if}}><span><strong>Allow Self Voting</strong><small>Applies only to Actor Vote questions.</small></span></label>
              <label class="pr-compact-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="profilePublicBallots" {{#if publicBallots}}checked{{/if}}><span><strong>Public Ballots</strong><small>Reveal who voted for what only after finalization.</small></span></label>
            </div>

            <div class="pr-config-list pr-question-config-list" data-question-list>
              {{#each questions}}
                <article class="pr-question-row" data-config-row="question" data-id="{{id}}" data-last-actor-points="{{points}}">
                  <div class="pr-question-head">
                    <span class="pr-position" data-position>#{{position}}</span>
                    <label>Title<input name="questionTitle" value="{{title}}" maxlength="80" required></label>
                    <label>Short Label<input name="questionShort" value="{{shortLabel}}" maxlength="12" required></label>
                    <label>Type<select name="questionType"><option value="actor" {{#if isActor}}selected{{/if}}>Actor Vote</option><option value="option" {{#if isOption}}selected{{/if}}>Option Vote</option></select></label>
                    <label class="pr-points-field">Points<input name="questionPoints" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="{{points}}" {{#if isOption}}disabled{{/if}}></label>
                    <div class="pr-row-actions"><button type="button" data-row-action="up" data-tooltip="Move left"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i></button><button type="button" data-row-action="down" data-tooltip="Move right"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></button><button type="button" data-row-action="delete" data-tooltip="Delete question"><i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i></button></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="pr-question-body">
                    <label class="pr-field pr-grow">Description<input name="questionDescription" value="{{description}}" maxlength="220"></label>
                    <label class="pr-mini-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="questionResolveTie" {{#if resolveTiesByGM}}checked{{/if}}><span><strong>GM resolves ties</strong><small>Unchecked accepts tied first-place results.</small></span></label>
                  </div>
                  <div class="pr-option-area" data-option-area {{#unless isOption}}hidden{{/unless}}>
                    <div class="pr-option-area-head"><span><strong>Answer Options</strong><small>Minimum {{../../minOptions}}, maximum {{../../maxOptions}}.</small></span><button type="button" data-row-action="add-option"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Add Option</button></div>
                    <div class="pr-option-list" data-option-list>
                      {{#each options}}
                        <div class="pr-option-row" data-config-row="option" data-id="{{id}}">
                          <span class="pr-option-position" data-option-position>{{position}}</span>
                          <label>Label<input name="optionLabel" value="{{label}}" maxlength="80" required></label>
                          <label class="pr-grow">Description<input name="optionDescription" value="{{description}}" maxlength="180"></label>
                          <div class="pr-row-actions"><button type="button" data-row-action="up" data-tooltip="Move up"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up"></i></button><button type="button" data-row-action="down" data-tooltip="Move down"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></button><button type="button" data-row-action="delete" data-tooltip="Delete option"><i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i></button></div>
                        </div>
                      {{/each}}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </article>
              {{/each}}
            </div>
          </section>
        {{/each}}
      </div>
      <p class="pr-setting-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Actor Vote points may be <strong>0</strong> for an informational poll. Option Votes are always informational and therefore use 0 points. Short Labels keep Actor Vote grids compact; mouseover shows the full Title and Description.</p>
    </section>

    <section data-settings-panel="reasons" hidden>
      <div class="pr-section-header"><div><h2>Give Point Reasons</h2><p>Reusable positive point awards for the GM Manager. A Custom option is always available there.</p></div><div class="pr-section-actions"><button type="button" data-export-config="give-point-reasons"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-export"></i> Export</button><button type="button" data-import-config="give-point-reasons"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-import"></i> Import</button><button type="button" data-action="add-reason"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Add Reason</button></div></div>
      <div class="pr-config-list" data-reason-list>
        {{#each reasons}}
          <article class="pr-config-row" data-config-row="reason" data-id="{{id}}" data-virtual="{{#if virtual}}true{{else}}false{{/if}}">
            <label>Title<input name="reasonTitle" value="{{title}}" maxlength="80" required></label>
            <label class="pr-grow">Description<input name="reasonDescription" value="{{description}}" maxlength="220"></label>
            <label class="pr-points-field">Points<input name="reasonPoints" type="number" min="1" step="1" value="{{points}}" required></label>
            <div class="pr-row-actions"><button type="button" data-row-action="up" data-tooltip="Move up"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up"></i></button><button type="button" data-row-action="down" data-tooltip="Move down"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></button><button type="button" data-row-action="delete" data-tooltip="Delete reason"><i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i></button></div>
          </article>
        {{/each}}
      </div>
      <p class="pr-setting-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> If the list is empty, an editable symbolic <strong>Default +1</strong> row appears automatically. Saving it turns it into a normal configured reason.</p>
    </section>

    <section data-settings-panel="benefits" hidden>
      <div class="pr-section-header"><div><h2>Redeem Benefits</h2><p>Benefits are always preconfigured. There is no Custom redemption in the GM Manager.</p></div><div class="pr-section-actions"><button type="button" data-export-config="redeem-benefits"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-export"></i> Export</button><button type="button" data-import-config="redeem-benefits"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-import"></i> Import</button><button type="button" data-action="add-benefit"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Add Benefit</button></div></div>
      <div class="pr-config-list" data-benefit-list>
        {{#each benefits}}
          <article class="pr-config-row" data-config-row="benefit" data-id="{{id}}" data-virtual="{{#if virtual}}true{{else}}false{{/if}}">
            <label>Name<input name="benefitName" value="{{name}}" maxlength="80" required></label>
            <label class="pr-grow">Description<input name="benefitDescription" value="{{description}}" maxlength="260" required></label>
            <label class="pr-points-field">Cost<input name="benefitCost" type="number" min="1" step="1" value="{{cost}}" required></label>
            <div class="pr-row-actions"><button type="button" data-row-action="up" data-tooltip="Move up"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up"></i></button><button type="button" data-row-action="down" data-tooltip="Move down"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></button><button type="button" data-row-action="delete" data-tooltip="Delete benefit"><i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i></button></div>
          </article>
        {{/each}}
      </div>
      <p class="pr-setting-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Benefit Name, Description, and Cost are mandatory. With no saved benefits, an editable symbolic Default benefit is shown.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="pr-footer"><button type="button" data-action="cancel"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i> Cancel</button><button type="button" class="pr-primary" data-action="save"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save Settings</button></footer>
</div>
